Local modifications:

  1. Import paths rewritten from vitess.io/vitess/go/mysql/collations to
     github.com/acorndb/shardweave/pkg/mysql/collation.
  2. local.go: CollationForType removed (sqltypes dependency eliminated). The
     proxy reads the collation ID from the result-set column definition.
  3. colldata: the Hash method was removed from the Collation interface and all
     implementations, and cached_size.go was deleted (vthash/hack dependencies
     eliminated). Hashing is not used by the merge engine.
  4. charset/convert.go: hack.StringBytes replaced with a plain []byte
     conversion (same semantics, one allocation).
  5. Test files under colldata/ and internal/ that require vitess-only test
     utilities were dropped; upstream golden tests at the package root and under
     charset/ are retained and run in CI.
